{"id":"prekrasno","lemma":"прекрасно","pos":"adv","rank":279,"glosses":["beautifully, great, gorgeously, well, nicely"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/66/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это так прекрасно.","en":"It's so beautiful.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Я прекрасно помню тот день.","en":"I remember that day very well.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to remember","l":"помнить"},{"g":"that one, those ones"},{"g":"day, daytime"}]},{"text":"Я прекрасно могу его понять.","en":"I can understand him perfectly.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"to understand"}]},{"text":"Ты прекрасно знаешь, чего я хочу.","en":"You know very well what I want.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what for? why?"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"}]},{"text":"Ты сегодня вечером прекрасно выглядишь.","en":"You look beautiful this evening.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"today"},{"g":"in the evening"},null,{"g":"to look","l":"выглядеть"}]}]}